  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Through intense dedication, meditation, and study given over to the pursuit of physical and metaphysical perfection, the character awakens to the presence of ki in the world and within his own body. The character is proicient at using and shaping ki and can develop and channel his ki to perform amazing accomplishments normally attributed to magic.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Wis 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a ki pool of 2 ki points and can take ki feats and chakra feats.</p>\n<p><sup>Wiki Note: Despite the focus on Ki, this was published as a General feat.</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc69\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
